On the Robustness of Graph Reduction Against GNN Backdoor
Yuxuan Zhu Michael Mandulak Kerui Wu Rensselaer Polytechnic Institute Troy, NY, USA {zhuy27,mandum,wuk9}@rpi.edu
George Slota Rensselaer Polytechnic Institute Troy, NY, USA slotag@rpi.edu
